I arrive at Priya's building.
I stand in front of the door.
I ring the doorbell.
Priya opens the door.
She sees me and smiles warmly.
"Welcome, Maya!"
"Come inside," Priya says.
I go inside.
I open my bag.
I take out the box of sweets from the bag.
"Priya, this is for you," I say.
I give that box to Priya.
Priya accepts the box.
"Wow, Kaju Katli!"
"Thank you very much," she says with joy.
"We will definitely eat this after the meal," Priya says.
I think that this will be very delicious.
"Now, let's go to the kitchen," Priya says.
